WEBVTT

00:04:30.796 --> 00:04:32.276
The human cost,

00:04:32.316 --> 00:04:37.476
the economic toll that can come
if we don't seize this opportunity,

00:04:37.516 --> 00:04:40.876
which could create
25 million jobs, new jobs,

00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:42.916
in the next decade alone --

00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:44.716
or wreck our communities.

00:04:45.116 --> 00:04:47.116
I want to ask you, friends,

00:04:47.116 --> 00:04:50.716
how much more damage do we have to endure

00:04:50.716 --> 00:04:55.076
before we realize that it's cheaper
to save this planet than to ruin it?

00:04:55.676 --> 00:04:59.396
(Applause)